# Mentalis AI Integration Environment Variables (Groq Provider)
# -----------------------------------------------------------
# Mentalis is an offline-first cognitive arithmetic platform.
# All arithmetic generation, scoring, diagnostic estimation,
# and daily personalized training plans work 100% locally
# and privately without any external AI API key.
#
# If you wish to enable the optional AI Coach for deeper personalized
# pedagogical insights, lesson cards, and plan explanations:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local: cp .env.example .env.local
# 2. Add your official Groq API key below.
# 3. Never commit .env.local to version control.
# -----------------------------------------------------------

# Secure Server-Side Groq API Key (Never exposed to client bundles or browser code)
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Production Groq Model (Defaults to llama-3.3-70b-versatile or llama-3.1-8b-instant if unspecified)
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
